@startuml
title RuleSphere - Integrated Communication Diagram\nEnd-to-End System Collaboration (COMET Analysis Model F-02)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam objectBackgroundColor #EAF6F8
skinparam objectBorderColor #177E8D
skinparam ArrowColor #496477
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam nodesep 50
skinparam ranksep 60

' Actors
object "author : DecisionAuthor" as Author <<actor>>
object "approver : GovernanceReviewer" as Approver <<actor>>
object "client : ConsumerApplication" as Client <<actor>>

' Control Plane Boundaries & Controllers
object "mgmtAPI : ManagementAPI" as MgmtAPI <<boundary>>
object "decisionMgr : DecisionManager" as DecMgr <<service>>
object "validator : DecisionValidator" as Validator <<service>>
object "govCtrl : GovernanceController" as GovCtrl <<state dependent control>>
object "builder : ArtifactBuilder" as Builder <<service>>

' Delivery Plane
object "publisher : DesiredStatePublisher" as Publisher <<service>>

' Data Plane
object "runtimeAPI : RuntimeAdapter" as RunAPI <<boundary>>
object "evalSvc : EvaluationCoordinator" as EvalSvc <<coordinator>>
object "resolver : SnapshotResolver" as Resolver <<service>>
object "executor : GraphExecutor" as Executor <<service>>
object "traceSvc : TraceCaptureService" as TraceSvc <<service>>

' Stores / Entities
object "artifactRepo : ArtifactRepository" as ArtifactRepo <<entity>>
object "complianceStore : ComplianceLedger" as ComplianceStore <<entity>>

' Collaborations & Messages

' 1. Authoring & Validation Flow
Author --> MgmtAPI : 1: authorDraft(draftGraph, schema)
MgmtAPI --> DecMgr : 1.1: saveDraftRevision()
DecMgr --> Validator : 1.2: validateDAGAndContracts()
Validator --> DecMgr : 1.3: validationReport

' 2. Governance Flow
Author --> MgmtAPI : 2: submitCandidate(version)
MgmtAPI --> GovCtrl : 2.1: submitReleaseCandidate()
Approver --> MgmtAPI : 3: recordReview(approve, reason)
MgmtAPI --> GovCtrl : 3.1: applyApprovalEvidence()
GovCtrl --> Builder : 3.2 [all approvals satisfied]: buildApprovedArtifact()
Builder --> ArtifactRepo : 3.3: storeImmutableBytecode()

' 3. Distribution Flow
GovCtrl --> Publisher : 4: publishDesiredState(targetVersion)
Publisher --> Resolver : 4.1 <<async event>>: notifyDesiredState()
Resolver --> ArtifactRepo : 4.2: fetchImmutableArtifact()

' 4. Runtime Evaluation Flow
Client --> RunAPI : 5: evaluate(request, context, optionalPin)
RunAPI --> EvalSvc : 5.1: evaluateRequest()
EvalSvc --> Resolver : 5.2: resolveAtomicSnapshot()
EvalSvc --> Executor : 5.3: executeDAG(snapshot, input)
Executor --> EvalSvc : 5.4: executionResult
EvalSvc --> TraceSvc : 5.5 <<async>>: captureTrace(result, executionId)
TraceSvc --> ComplianceStore : 5.6: persistProtectedEvidence()
RunAPI ..> Client : 5.7: evaluationOutcome

note bottom of GovCtrl
  Enforces Maker-Checker and Tier 1..3 quorums.
  Rejection returns candidate to Draft state.
end note

note bottom of EvalSvc
  Evaluates from local in-memory cache.
  Zero synchronous dependency on Control Plane (AC-04).
  Trace handoff is asynchronous.
end note

legend bottom
  Integrated COMET Communication Diagram synthesizing subsystems (Authoring, Governance, Distribution, Runtime, Audit).
  Stereotypes: <<actor>>, <<boundary>>, <<service>>, <<coordinator>>, <<state dependent control>>, <<entity>>.
endlegend
@enduml
